    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University mourns the passing of Dr Fay Ruth Dirks, MD, FRCPC, who died on November 21, 2025, at the age of 92. Her passing marks the loss of a pivotal figure who quietly shaped the academic foundation of the Medical College during its formative years in Karachi.",
